---
layout: null
permalink: /search.json
---
{%- comment -%}
The search index, built at build time and fetched once — on the first ⌘K, not
on page load — so its size costs nothing to a reader who never searches.

Three kinds of record share one array, because Lunr indexes one corpus and the
palette groups the hits afterwards:

  post  every document in the five collections, full text included
  page  the standalone pages worth finding
  tag   one per distinct tag, so "poetry" finds the tag as well as the posts

The full article text is indexed on purpose: search should find a phrase buried
mid-post, not only titles and abstracts. That makes this file grow with the
archive — a deliberate trade. If the fetch itself ever becomes slow, capping
`content` with `truncatewords` is the lever, not dropping the field.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pool = '' | split: '' -%}
{%- for domain in site.data.domains -%}
    {%- assign pool = pool | concat: site[domain.collection] -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign posts = pool | sort: 'date' | reverse -%}

{%- comment -%}
Distinct tags, collected the same way _layouts/category.html collects
sub-topics: probed wrapped in pipes so one tag cannot match as a prefix of
another ("ai" inside "aid").
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tag_bag = '|' -%}
{%- for post in posts -%}
    {%- for tag in post.tags -%}
        {%- assign probe = tag | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
        {%- unless tag_bag contains probe -%}
            {%- assign tag_bag = tag_bag | append: tag | append: '|' -%}
        {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign tags = tag_bag | split: '|' -%}

{%- comment -%}
Pages worth finding. Listed rather than looped over site.pages: that would
sweep in the styleguide, the compose tool, 404 and search.json itself.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign findable = "/about/|/all-posts/|/tags/" | split: "|" -%}
[
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for post in posts -%}
    {%- assign domain = site.data.domains | where: 'collection', post.collection | first -%}
    {%- unless first %},{% endunless %}{% assign first = false %}
  {
    "kind": "post",
    "id": {{ post.url | jsonify }},
    "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "domain": {{ post.collection | jsonify }},
    "domainName": {{ domain.title | jsonify }},
    "tags": {{ post.tags | join: ' ' | jsonify }},
    "abstract": {{ post.abstract | default: post.description | default: '' | jsonify }},
    "content": {{ post.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }},
    "date": {{ post.date | date: "%m.%Y" | jsonify }},
    "sort": {{ post.date | date: "%s" | jsonify }}
  }
{%- endfor -%}

{%- for page in site.pages -%}
    {%- if findable contains page.url -%}
    {%- unless first %},{% endunless %}{% assign first = false %}
  {
    "kind": "page",
    "id": {{ page.url | jsonify }},
    "title": {{ page.title | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ page.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "domain": "",
    "domainName": "Page",
    "tags": "",
    {%- comment -%}
    `| default: ''` matters: jsonify turns a missing key into a literal null,
    and Lunr indexes fields by reading them, not by checking them.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    "abstract": {{ page.description | default: '' | jsonify }},
    "content": {{ page.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }},
    "date": "",
    "sort": "0"
  }
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- for tag in tags -%}
    {%- if tag != '' -%}
        {%- assign tag_count = 0 -%}
        {%- for post in posts -%}
            {%- if post.tags contains tag -%}
                {%- assign tag_count = tag_count | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
    {%- unless first %},{% endunless %}{% assign first = false %}
  {
    "kind": "tag",
    "id": {{ tag | slugify | prepend: '#' | jsonify }},
    "title": {{ tag | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ tag | slugify | prepend: '/tags/#' | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "domain": "",
    "domainName": "Tag",
    "tags": {{ tag | jsonify }},
    "abstract": "",
    "content": "",
    {%- if tag_count == 1 -%}
        {%- assign tag_label = '1 post' -%}
    {%- else -%}
        {%- assign tag_label = tag_count | append: ' posts' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    "date": {{ tag_label | jsonify }},
    "sort": "0"
  }
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
